WEBVTT

00:08:30.445 --> 00:08:32.730
Personalized genomic massage, anyone?

00:08:33.778 --> 00:08:38.345
There's already a lab today that tests
for allele 334 of the AVPR1 gene,

00:08:38.369 --> 00:08:39.753
the so-called cheating gene.

00:08:39.777 --> 00:08:41.792
(Laughter)

00:08:41.816 --> 00:08:44.443
So anybody who's here today
with your significant other,

00:08:44.467 --> 00:08:47.334
just turn over to them,
swab their mouth, send it to the lab

00:08:47.358 --> 00:08:48.627
and you'll know for sure.

00:08:48.651 --> 00:08:49.762
(Laughter)

00:08:49.786 --> 00:08:51.728
Do you really want to elect a president

00:08:51.752 --> 00:08:54.014
whose genome suggests cardiomyopathy?

00:08:54.038 --> 00:08:55.898
Think of it -- it's 2016,

00:08:55.922 --> 00:08:57.628
and the leading candidate releases

00:08:57.652 --> 00:08:59.734
not only her four years
of back-tax returns,

00:08:59.758 --> 00:09:01.211
but also her personal genome.